    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>. Then, the number of elements in the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>}</mo><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
